From ec569d27b87ed34c86cf6adfeb62acdedb36b795 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: brunduk <nikolai.viktorovich@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 12:53:34 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] d/wmr: Fix G2 controller haptic output name

The G2 controller advertised XRT_OUTPUT_NAME_WMR_HAPTIC while both its
binding profiles and bindings.json reference
XRT_OUTPUT_NAME_G2_CONTROLLER_HAPTIC, and oxr_xdev_find_output() matches
by name - so a haptic action bound on the G2 profile could never
resolve to the device.

Actually driving the motor still needs the wire command, which is not
implemented (or documented in-tree) yet; this makes the action resolve
so that path can be built on.

Signed-off-by: brunduk <nikolai.viktorovich@gmail.com>
---
 src/xrt/drivers/wmr/wmr_controller_hp.c | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/xrt/drivers/wmr/wmr_controller_hp.c b/src/xrt/drivers/wmr/wmr_controller_hp.c
index aae16b37e..ef17708d6 100644
--- a/src/xrt/drivers/wmr/wmr_controller_hp.c
+++ b/src/xrt/drivers/wmr/wmr_controller_hp.c
@@ -402,7 +402,9 @@ wmr_controller_hp_create(struct wmr_controller_connection *conn,
 
 	ctrl->last_inputs.imu.timestamp_ticks = 0;
 
-	wcb->base.outputs[0].name = XRT_OUTPUT_NAME_WMR_HAPTIC;
+	// Must match what the binding profiles and bindings.json reference
+	// (XRT_OUTPUT_NAME_G2_CONTROLLER_HAPTIC) or the haptic action can never resolve.
+	wcb->base.outputs[0].name = XRT_OUTPUT_NAME_G2_CONTROLLER_HAPTIC;
 
 	wcb->base.binding_profiles = binding_profiles;
 	wcb->base.binding_profile_count = ARRAY_SIZE(binding_profiles);
